<title>USA: Jamaica buys 2,500 tonnes U.S. brown rice - trade.</title>
<headline>Jamaica buys 2,500 tonnes U.S. brown rice - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jamaica bought on Tuesday 2,500 tonnes of U.S. bulk brown rice under the GSM-102 program at $351.00 a tonne, FOB, U.S. Gulf for December 10-25 delivery, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
